[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:Uncomfortable Shoes]
[00:01.10]Lesson 75 | 第75课
[00:03.22]Uncomfortable shoes | 不舒适的鞋
[00:06.45]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答问题。
[00:11.86]What's wrong with the fashionable shoes? | 这些时髦的鞋有什么问题？
[00:16.97]Do you have any shoes like these? | 你们有这种鞋吗？
[00:21.80]What size? | 多少尺码？
[00:23.46]Size five. | 5码。
[00:25.71]What colour? | 什么颜色？
[00:27.15]Black. | 黑色。
[00:28.56]I'm sorry. | 很抱歉。
[00:30.18]We don't have any. | 我们没有。
[00:32.54]But my sister bought this pair last month. | 可是我姐姐上个月买了一双这种鞋。
[00:37.45]Did she buy them here? | 她是在这儿买的吗？
[00:39.54]No, she bought them in the U. S. | 不，她是在美国买的。
[00:44.28]We had some shoes like those a month ago, but we don't have any now. | 一个月前我们有这种鞋，但现在没有了。
[00:51.58]Can you get a pair for me, please? | 您能给我进一双吗？
[00:55.29]I'm afraid that I can't. | 恐怕不能。
[00:58.31]They were in fashion last year and the year before last. | 这种鞋去年和前年很流行。
[01:03.96]But they're not in fashion this year. | 但今年不流行了。
[01:08.41]These shoes are in fashion now. | 现在这种鞋很流行。
[01:12.45]They look very uncomfortable. | 这种鞋看起来很不舒服。
[01:16.42]They are very uncomfortable. | 它们是很不舒服。
[01:19.21]But women always wear uncomfortable shoes! | 但是女士们总是穿不舒服的鞋！